flowchart LR
  LEGEND["CONFIRMED: direct evidence | DERIVED: SQL or measured relation<br/>PROPOSED: review required | UNRESOLVED: evidence gap"]
  RAW["Raw CSV archive<br/>No manager raw grant supplied"]
  CALC["Internal calculator<br/>Cross-unit rows only for supplied formulas"]
  POLICY["Required boundary before any LLM<br/>Row scope + columns + purpose + active dates"]
  QUERY["Authorized query projections<br/>Text-to-SQL has the same boundary"]
  REPORT["Authorized report evidence<br/>No source row grant follows from a KPI"]
  LLM["LLM sees authorized data only"]
  RAW -->|DERIVED computation| CALC
  CALC -->|CONFIRMED security requirement| POLICY
  POLICY -->|CONFIRMED scoped results| QUERY
  POLICY -->|CONFIRMED scoped evidence| REPORT
  QUERY --> LLM
  REPORT --> LLM
